From 0502e0b0bcd77155f1a11f1e7e9048e5dea8fc33 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: BellSoft <info@bell-sw.com>
Date: Mon, 19 Oct 2026 13:33:25 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Runtime types from the module's Products table

osv-internal 0.5.5 replaces its PURLNameJDK/PURLNameNIK constants by the
Products table: a vendor may build the module with several JDK and NIK
families. Every family gets its own package type, named by the family's purl
name (pkg.VendorRuntimeType, VendorRuntimeTypes, IsVendorRuntime); the
cataloger types a runtime by its family, and the purl mapping, the CPE
exclusion and the ownership-overlap rule follow.
---
